      "source_tag": "_t",
      "source": "#VIOLET#You enter the swirling portal and appear in a large room with other portals and the two wizards.",
      "target": "#VIOLET#你进入了传送漩涡，当你反应过来时，你发现你来到了一个有着数个传送门和两名魔导师的巨大房间里。",
